      "locked": false,
      "text": "Additional complications to add to simu\n- working in UMI space -> working in read space\n    - stars & bars algo to distro reads for simu\n    - For real data, maybe add function to expand rank : re-add omitted zeroes\n- BCs & BC distro\n",
