      "text": "does flattening barcodes cause inflation of strength estimate of CREs which happened \nto be cloned w/ more barcodes?\n- assuming all barcodes for one CRE are drawing from same NB : then just \"more samples from distro\"\n  not \"higher \"\n- for \"flattening\" = \"removing barcode information\" NOT sum (which would maybe increase a little if multi\nbc for one cre in one cell). ",
